{"file":"ml-pipeline-0.4.0-v1.zip","bytes":147251,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"ml-pipeline","description":"Data-first ML discipline: forces coding agents through a strict 16-step pipeline — inspect and understand the raw data, define the prediction problem, clean, engineer, and split it BEFORE any model training — with explicit user-permission gates, marimo notebooks, and matplotlib visuals at every step.","version":"0.4.0","license":"Apache-2.0","keywords":["machine-learning","ml-pipeline","eda","data-cleaning","data-leakage","marimo","matplotlib","workflow-discipline"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"ml-pipeline","description":"Data-first ML discipline: forces coding agents through a strict 16-step pipeline — inspect and understand the raw data, define the prediction problem, clean, engineer, and split it BEFORE any model training — with explicit user-permission gates, marimo notebooks, and matplotlib visuals at every step.","version":"0.4.0","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/jananthan30/ml-pipeline","homepage":"https://github.com/jananthan30/ml-pipeline","keywords":["machine-learning","ml-pipeline","eda","data-cleaning","data-leakage","marimo","matplotlib","workflow-discipline"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/ml-pipeline/SKILL.md","name":"ml-pipeline","description":"MANDATORY whenever a task involves training, fine-tuning, tuning, or evaluating a machine-learning model on data (tabular, time series, text, images — any modality). Enforces a strict 16-step pipeline that starts with inspecting the raw data, gates each phase behind the user's explicit permission, and produces marimo notebooks with matplotlib visuals so the user can see and understand every step. Never jump straight to model training.","headings":["ML Pipeline Discipline","The pipeline (strict order — never reorder, never skip silently)","Phase gates — explicit permission, every time","Progress tracking (survives across sessions